  "description": "Self-contained protoc tooling that generates synchronous TCP packet-handler\n      service bases (IPacketHandler / [PacketHandler(MsgId)] / Connection) plus the C#\n      message classes from your .proto files, via a forked grpc_csharp_plugin. Ships its\n      own protoc and well-known-type includes; no Grpc.Tools dependency.\n      Windows-x64 only in this version.",
  "developmentDependency": true,
  "id": "Raphael.Tcp.Tools",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-02T17:40:57.68Z",
  "licenseExpression": "Apache-2.0",
